{"step_index":232,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-05T19:37:45Z","thinking":"Initial focus is on creating a responsive and modern welcome page. The `templates/index.html` file requires a redesign, as well as updating the `dashboard.html`, `style.css` and `app.js` files. The landing page design begins with a modern navigation bar, including a brand logo and various links for navigation.\n\n\nA prominent hero section will be integrated, featuring a welcome banner with a strong value proposition and an interactive verification component. Real-time verification results will be displayed clearly, including outcome badges, relevant credential details, and cryptographic proofs. System statistics and feature highlights will be presented in a concise grid to emphasize key benefits.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Qualification Verification System | Public Portal & Blockchain Ledger</title>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <!-- Top Announcement Bar -->\n    <div class=\"top-announcement\">\n        <span>🛡️ <strong>DevOps-Enabled QVS 2.0</strong> • Immutable Blockchain Ledger • Agentic AI Fraud Shield • Multi-Cloud Ready</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"navbar\">\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <a href=\"/\" class=\"nav-brand\">\n                <div class=\"brand-logo\">🎓</div>\n                <div class=\"brand-text\">\n                    <span class=\"brand-title\">DevOps QVS</span>\n                    <span class=\"brand-subtitle\">Enterprise Verification</span>\n        